==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[LeMurr]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[R.Ost]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[LeMurr]] spawns.
**10 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**4 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 43.33~50 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,500f</sup>.
**1 [[LeMurr]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
**1 [[LeMurr]] spawns after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is a straightforward R.Ost stage with Brollow and LeMurr as the main support. Since this stage is on base hit, you can use the starting enemies to build up your wallet. When you hit the base, lure R.Ost and spam your midrangers like [[Bowler Cat (Rare Cat)|Bowler Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]] to kill him, while you use [[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Bubble Cat]] and [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to chip away at the supporting peons.

==Trivia==
*Ink Museum's Japanese name, Ikasumyūjiamu (イカスミュージアム), is a portmanteau of いかすみ ''ikasumi'' (squid ink) and ミュージアム ''myūjiamu'' (museum).
*Ink Museum and [[Floating Bus Stop]] are designed like late [[Stories of Legend]] stages, [[Coral Housing]] and [[Kelp Campsite]] are designed like late [[Uncanny Legends]] stages, and [[Renovated Shipwreck]] and [[Jetsam Lookout]] are typical [[Zero Legends]] stages.

